  sentences:
  - Me?
  - Yes! My princess, the lady with the strong gaze and great poise. My heart burns
    for you my lady!
  - ...
  - You do realise that I'm the ruler of this country? I can't just marry anyone.
  - My princess is even greater than I thought. Fear not, I shall anhilate all your
    enemies. Roar!
  - '*Sigh*'
  - ... I will grant you one date.
  - A chance is all I ask for my Princess! I will this tournament to prove my worth,
    than I shall woo you on our date.
  - How romantic!
  - '*Ahem*'
  - Well then. Let the tournament begin!
